  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1126519/description_a88321bd-c36e-4f18-a8cc-756fc80e6800.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"44\"></p>\n<p>這是一個材質包，可在不安裝任何模組的情況下，為《Minecraft》中的物品添加食物資訊！&nbsp;</p>\n<p><br><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/992/572/food_text_items.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"347\" height=\"187\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1126519/description_7fbfcd32-146b-4905-96c0-0f6fbe5bf249.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"44\"></p>\n<p>此資源包支援超多語言：英文、西班牙文、葡萄牙文、法文、義大利文等。<br>此資源包相容於：Optifine、Embeddium、Rubiddium、&nbsp; Sodium。&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1126519/description_e499b5ac-b70a-4245-bcc8-e20c07043bc4.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"44\"></p>\n<p>如果您想支持我們，可以加入我們的 &nbsp;<span style=\"color:#3598db\"><a style=\"color:#3598db\" href=\"https://discord.gg/WaXqmwdRJW\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord</a></span> 或透過我們的<span style=\"color:#3598db\">&nbsp;<a style=\"color:#3598db\" href=\"https://www.patreon.com/RenovatedStudios\" rel=\"nofollow\">Patreon</a></span> 進行贊助。</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/N6TsrGvzvZ\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1017834/description_f9406618-0e4f-4d0a-92da-5376ba49b9e8.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"354\" height=\"82\"></a><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/RenovatedStudios\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1017834/description_fb2b698d-66ca-4888-a0c3-460d706e5304.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"354\" height=\"82\"></a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1126519/description_26915203-8bba-4b83-bea5-dc8f4accd465.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"44\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/better-minecraft-vanilla-textures\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"font-weight:400\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1126519/description_7dd77af1-aaa6-4d40-92a6-1ca5913ffee4.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\"></a> &nbsp; </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/glow-ores-emissive-vanilla\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1126519/description_7b65427d-b7c1-4d52-99aa-e4387a97108a.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\"> </a> &nbsp; &nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/data-packs/blood-n-particles\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"font-weight:400;color:#3598db\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1126519/description_58fe1d14-1950-4fff-9eda-43c9f21eaf68.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\"> </a> &nbsp; &nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/glow-ores-universal\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"color:#3598db\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1126519/description_5802eb45-36cb-4984-bdc1-bf79f87bd55a.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\"></a> &nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/glow-armors-universal\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1126519/description_54df1741-2b11-4863-9172-c4ed1e54c4cf.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\"></a> <br><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dawn-of-the-flood\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1126519/description_bb6bde22-5da6-4d94-a4bc-3855f359e78d.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\"></a></p>",
